  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f39ed32-9c81-4037-88ac-d3b8b57d8c66",
    "name": "COMP3123 Assignment 1 API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58560842",
    "description": "Manual test collection. Set base_url and fresh token_a/token_b values locally after login; shared token defaults are empty. The expired-token test requires an intentionally expired JWT signed by this API. Employee IDs refer to the documented test database. For repeat delete tests, create new temporary employees and replace the deleted IDs with the newly returned IDs. The controlled 500 request requires the separate local error-handler test server on port 8082; it is not a deployed API endpoint."
  },
